  <constraints>
    <constraint source="spec / Success Criteria 1-8">Scope: verify ALL 8 criteria. Each MUST map to a concrete verifying artifact and receive a GREEN or RED verdict. Completion is authorized ONLY on all-green.</constraint>
    <constraint source="spec / Success Criterion 8 / NFR-08">Verify the commit/PR ordering shows task 006 (Phase 0 gate) GREEN before ANY old-path deletion (023/032/060). If the ordering is violated, criterion 8 is RED.</constraint>
    <constraint source="project / CLAUDE.md §6">If ANY criterion is RED, the project cannot close — BLOCK task 090 and escalate per root §6; do NOT record an all-green verdict on partial evidence.</constraint>
    <constraint source="project / CLAUDE.md §6.5">Any ADR tension surfaced during the audit is resolved via Path A/B/C, not silently — cite the resolution in the decision doc.</constraint>
  </constraints>

