  <steps mode="directional">
    <step order="0" name="Context + rigor declaration">Output the FULL rigor-level declaration (reason: final judgment gate, gate/review tags). Confirm task 062 (deploy + UAT) is DONE. Load the spec Success Criteria + the evidence artifacts.</step>
    <step order="1" name="Map + verdict criteria 1-2">Verify byte-preserving (corpus byte-diff harness 034/061) and placement determinism (corpus + code audit + seam tests; zero write-path text-search). Record artifact + GREEN/RED for each.</step>
    <step order="2" name="Map + verdict criteria 3-5">Verify AI drift-proof (concurrent-edit ProseMirror test 042 + CIPO UAT 062), concurrency (stale-base re-anchor + 423 seam 054 + UAT 062), and structural edits (split/merge/insert/delete corpus round-trip 031/034). Record artifact + verdict.</step>
    <step order="3" name="Map + verdict criteria 6-8">Verify Word-native output (CIPO UAT open-in-Word-for-web 062), hard-replace complete (grep 060 + publish size 061 + CI green), and Phase-0-gate-before-cutover (git commit/PR ordering: 006 green before 023/032/060 deletions). Record artifact + verdict.</step>
    <step order="4" name="Render verdict + finalize">Write `notes/flagship-gate-decision.md` with the full 8-criterion mapping and an overall verdict. If all-green, authorize task 090; if any red, BLOCK 090 and escalate per root §6. Update `projects/spaarkeai-compose-r4/tasks/TASK-INDEX.md`: set this task's status to ✅ (only if the gate rendered; record the verdict either way). Document any deviation in `projects/spaarkeai-compose-r4/notes/`.</step>
  </steps>

